            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary 1983 ZX Spectrum classic <i>Bugaboo (La Pulga)</i>, <strong>Flix the Flea</strong> is a modern reimagining of one of gaming’s earliest precision jumping challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with the blessing of Bugaboo’s original creator, Flix the Flea keeps the spirit of the classic alive while bringing smooth scrolling, modern presentation and new levels to the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn but tricky to master, Flix’s unique jump mechanics challenge players to carefully control momentum to escape dangerous caverns filled with hazards. Every jump matters — and a single mistake can send you tumbling back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its pick-up-and-play design and arcade-style challenge, Flix the Flea captures the feel of classic skill-based games where practice, patience and precision are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspired by the ZX Spectrum classic <i>Bugaboo (La Pulga)</i><br>• Precision jumping gameplay built around momentum mechanics<br>• 10 challenging levels to master<br>• Smooth scrolling and modern presentation<br>• Fast pick-up-and-play arcade gameplay<br>• Designed for quick runs and repeated attempts</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the legendary 1983 ZX Spectrum classic <i>Bugaboo (La Pulga)</i>, <strong>Flix the Flea</strong> is a modern reimagining of one of gaming’s earliest precision jumping challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with the blessing of Bugaboo’s original creator, Flix the Flea keeps the spirit of the classic alive while bringing smooth scrolling, modern presentation and new levels to the experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to learn but tricky to master, Flix’s unique jump mechanics challenge players to carefully control momentum to escape dangerous caverns filled with hazards. Every jump matters — and a single mistake can send you tumbling back down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its pick-up-and-play design and arcade-style challenge, Flix the Flea captures the feel of classic skill-based games where practice, patience and precision are the keys to success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Inspired by the ZX Spectrum classic <i>Bugaboo (La Pulga)</i><br>• Precision jumping gameplay built around momentum mechanics<br>• 10 challenging levels to master<br>• Smooth scrolling and modern presentation<br>• Fast pick-up-and-play arcade gameplay<br>• Designed for quick runs and repeated attempts</p>",
            "short_description": "Inspired by the legendary ZX Spectrum classic Bugaboo (La Pulga), Flix the Flea is a precision arcade platformer where every jump counts. Master momentum, bounce through deadly caverns, and conquer ten challenging levels in this deceptively simple but brutally addictive skill game.",
